lt-in `Ctrl+S` screenshot feature using demonstration data.*"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Get started"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"You need Node.js `^22.19` or `>=24`, the `dsh` CLI, `pnpm`, an interactive terminal, and a configure"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d model route. See the installation guide for compatibility and setup details."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Type your first message to start a session. Use `Ctrl+P` for settings, `Tab` to change thinking inte"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nsity, and `Ctrl+S` to save a screenshot."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"For installation options, shortcuts, settings, troubleshooting, and development, read the English gu"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"on options, shortcuts, settings, troubleshooting, and development, read the English guide or 中文用户手册."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"LGPL-3.0-or-later."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
